    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "34617d550e2a197acda8": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "5194dbd466a173733265": "I seek more training in the priestly ways.",
        "76aa6d8885b51080afda": "Yes, $c?",
        "7b28252c2c483288111a": "Let me browse your goods.",
        "e09720a8dd2fbc0cd9e6": "Ah, you're the one who found the letter. Thank you for the... news, I suppose, about my family. You're welcome to what food and drink I can offer.",
        "ed7e9a0477748e5e14d4": "What can this insignificant servant do for you, $n? Training perhaps?"
      },
      "name": "Miles Welsh",
      "subName": "Priest Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
